      "widgets_values": [
        "{\n  \"scene\": \"A contemporary apartment bathroom viewed through the reflection of a sleek, ultra-thin matte black metal frame. The reflected room is in a state of realistic disarray: clothes are piled on a stool in the corner, the vanity counter is overflowing with open makeup bags, brushes, hair tools, and skincare bottles. A damp towel hangs crookedly over the glass shower door, and a coffee mug sits on the edge of the sink.\",\n  \"subjects\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"A woman in her mid-20s with messy, loosely tied-up hair with stray strands and natural, slightly smudged makeup. She wears a sheer black lace triangle bikini top and bottoms. She holds a smartphone in a slightly worn case, looking at the screen with a spontaneous, relaxed half-smile, caught mid-motion.\",\n      \"pose\": \"Candid, slightly off-balance standing pose, holding the phone up quickly with one hand to capture the reflection. Her posture is relaxed and unposed.\",\n      \"position\": \"Centered within the mirror reflection, amidst the clutter.\",\n      \"color_palette\": [\n        \"#1A1A1A\",\n        \"#D4B9A5\",\n        \"#2C2C2C\",\n        \"#8B5A2B\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"style\": \"Raw, unedited smartphone snapshot, 'plendid' candid aesthetic. High film grain, slightly imperfect composition, natural color tones, authentic social media capture feel.\",\n  \"lighting\": \"Mixed and somewhat imperfect illumination. Bright natural light from a window mixes with warm overhead vanity bulbs, creating realistic shadows and highlights across the clutter.\",\n  \"camera\": {\n    \"angle\": \"Eye-level selfie angle, slightly rushed.\",\n    \"focal_length\": \"26mm (smartphone wide lens)\",\n    \"f_stop\": \"f/2.0\",\n    \"focus\": \"Sharp focus on the subject's face and phone, with the chaotic background slightly blurred due to movement and depth.\"\n  },\n  \"color_palette\": [\n    \"#2C2C2C\",\n    \"#D4B9A5\",\n    \"#A0A0A0\",\n    \"#8B4513\",\n    \"#F5F5DC\"\n  ]\n}"
      ],
